@@ -74,6 +74,9 @@ Removed
 Changed
 ~~~~~~~
 
+- Messages about a finished process now include its PID in the `:process` hint,
+  and show the name of the signal if a process crashed. A process terminated
+  via SIGTERM doesn't show an error anymore, unless `--verbose` is given.
 - The qutebrowser icons got moved from `icons/` to `qutebrowser/icons` in the
   repository, so that it's possible for qutebrowser to load them using Python's
   resource system (rather than compiling them into a Qt resource file).
